  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_02",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "别让恐惧支配你，伊莱娜。穿过拱门。",
    "source_sha256": "5059eb88452fd3e520bc4a08ab10969bc033528d56637cb9b30355fa1db12121",
    "source_length": 65,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_03",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "你等得越久，情况就会越糟。",
    "source_sha256": "22dde8c64b47b6fdd80021e9d59b7a04b8826d43b6726c5ecd95fc4ba40637c5",
    "source_length": 42,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_04",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "孩子，别让我失望。",
    "source_sha256": "a7db21970c835b221d35c585bba21ffe3df0549fd1697a6221ea87abbe9a9795",
    "source_length": 27,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_05",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "孩子，你必须直面恐惧，否则就会被逐出白塔。",
    "source_sha256": "c3f6d4377a4f91452e24bd029b59b232513b4e12205b09601a13158988a8a409",
    "source_length": 63,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_06",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "我不能强迫你，伊莱娜。这件事必须由你自己完成。",
    "source_sha256": "e214ae5f99d316971249fcc00cbee75533b65ea7c3cbf9befa3aa79db12d09cd",
    "source_length": 65,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_07",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "我在你身上倾注了许多心血。别让我蒙羞。",
    "source_sha256": "3de7217e4ebde32cd4059356fea818e0ba2556257263a725277a3431db6c7a41",
    "source_length": 44,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_08",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "责任重于山，死亡轻于羽。死亡也不能让你逃避恐惧。",
    "source_sha256": "bd0596358a6d168a6c2c988ea2fb53c8312f06602f30d4dfe580cf973c9f575b",
    "source_length": 105,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_09",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "别向恐惧屈服，伊莱娜。你必须成功。",
    "source_sha256": "0b6d5f5fef3914dff67c42bb5c2929817d602390b04eb66b761fe16724b241c6",
    "source_length": 55,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_10",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，你小时候很好奇。一次塌方将你困在这座黑暗的洞穴里。你害怕黑暗，在被堵住的入口处蜷缩了几个小时。最后，村里有人把你挖了出来。这一次不会有人来救你。你从未真正探索过这座洞穴，所以这里由你的猜想构成，呈现出你所恐惧的模样。你必须面对它，逃出去。",
    "source_sha256": "aba55659234f5e0d3c29fb27c84f83bfefa5b2b08a2364bf8aaa574d3a0838cd",
    "source_length": 381,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_11",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "听从我的指引，一切都会顺利。这片洞穴里可以安全走动。四处探索一下。",
    "source_sha256": "adf16666c49e0ae151ed20ce187ed2a56ec0dac56647ba13dec145520ac0e29b",
    "source_length": 113,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_12",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "孩子，别动！",
    "source_sha256": "1e01bba73477b00c81b4f227e1b234cf82203ab582ee910cd710bf99ffed19b9",
    "source_length": 18,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_13",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "地震震开了通道。沿着它走，但要小心。你可能需要跳过一些碎石。",
    "source_sha256": "25b941c288452b795ebeb92f80659b605dcc329b212a5dc54a117de46006be38",
    "source_length": 108,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_14",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，出口就在眼前，却够不着。一定还有别的路能通往拱门。鼓起勇气，跳下去。",
    "source_sha256": "65889b518309539e3f27b597289c8de58d0cd85901990130d7dbf721e4b06f84",
    "source_length": 117,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_15",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "你可以害怕，但要直面恐惧，别逃避。",
    "source_sha256": "87496288f6ac29287f7d6189990c6a6eb10e3b91ffe225e963c215b9ad264efa",
    "source_length": 53,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_16",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "很好，孩子。水让你免于受伤，不过你还是可以采些这里的草根，留着以后用。它们能疗伤。",
    "source_sha256": "b30d1b695c28553edd82696874ddf2c2c16bdf0be8986bf8f3544be6b7ec9902",
    "source_length": 165,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_17",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "孩子，你受伤了。采些洞里的草根吧，它们能疗伤。",
    "source_sha256": "1266ab543be13065c5d7b55dceeac63dec53ab8342c2025b5426dcb940fc4a2c",
    "source_length": 98,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_18",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "休息一会儿。静止不动时，草根的疗效更好。",
    "source_sha256": "df85239b78adeb479bdad8fe50d5fe08dda8b151f6ec917db845a72e0b001a6d",
    "source_length": 54,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_19",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "你要知道，静止不动时，草根的疗效更好。",
    "source_sha256": "63f6fb2a903fd03c4a477e3d44b523932ced1a67fc2508498bbd1b76f9e5a4a8",
    "source_length": 59,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_20",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "看来唯一的出路在水里。潜下去。",
    "source_sha256": "19ad1a6ab1a3be47f8128edc24f9cd7429e698c45be99251abb996a413d3f054",
    "source_length": 56,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_21",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "别在水里待太久。两仪师也会溺水。",
    "source_sha256": "db3bd8050985bfdeb55b7bdb2561c5552a5cc6cc16b4d964f428eb2a2c401095",
    "source_length": 47,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_22",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "有光的地方就有出口。朝着光游过去。",
    "source_sha256": "0b5446160bbc01b2f8b508fcade9eff3d0ebd1453b77e9d983ec7eebd875cac8",
    "source_length": 62,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_23",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "这片水潭还有另一个出口。游过去。",
    "source_sha256": "c3cd0ba0ba4373456f6a038b20f9d56715b81cdc7e8747f7c1f608d8c9f979f3",
    "source_length": 47,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_24",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "上面还有另一个出口。游过去。",
    "source_sha256": "ad83f56037eba1e1d54607c8f2eefa82d699c91d47a41e42513d19057e441feb",
    "source_length": 43,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_25",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，快离开水里！你快淹死了。",
    "source_sha256": "cccdc56706aead8127e2f0b5ca96e13961913fe0011a204c9accba81cb2604a3",
    "source_length": 47,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_26",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "拱门就在附近，但你得先爬上去。道路已经断裂，你必须跳过缺口。当心地震。",
    "source_sha256": "1e8fca9af72a4d5868e9310da23025790dae4454f0f6ef87c093cb21adbfa54b",
    "source_length": 124,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_27",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "归途只会出现一次。穿过拱门。",
    "source_sha256": "72937ebc6c73d0a88ffff95d04fad6f55ed050f0e498c76630b4ff4b35e2d695",
    "source_length": 56,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_28",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，你做得很好，但这才刚开始。第二次试炼，面对的是现在。归途只会出现一次。坚定你的意志。",
    "source_sha256": "2a0a981f7d58cd0fe4546f2f922caccc6fc1727339e88dc601922006e6cb7574",
    "source_length": 130,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_29",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，你几乎没有导引至上力的能力，这让你备受掣肘。对失败的恐惧使你依赖特法器。可你仍躲在白塔里做研究，逃避外面的世界。只有新法器的诱惑才能让你离开白塔的庇护。这里是一名强大的暗黑之友的地下室，他也收藏特法器，并用陷阱保护藏品。你对这些法器的掌握，足以让你活着逃出去吗？",
    "source_sha256": "86c4bb84674eacc42c12221c7c8658bb3b47b16de0148495419818b46d755af2",
    "source_length": 458,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_30",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，试试那扇门，虽然门上的锁不是个好兆头。",
    "source_sha256": "1a2830133328111a97788cc36ef132e1f0997f10dcd1e6b248b672ebdb466572",
    "source_length": 58,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_31",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，试试那扇门。",
    "source_sha256": "50dc61a5dc8de87476b717ff71e2adf9ff263e0d18d1d97690503184eb2fb759",
    "source_length": 21,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_32",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "看来行不通。你得在这间储藏室里寻找别的出口，或找到这扇门的钥匙。",
    "source_sha256": "95f9cbf15db7706baf9c4c9004a1bf4022dd0645c2c7b48209853d74395e20ce",
    "source_length": 97,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_33",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "啊，一件特法器。拿起来。",
    "source_sha256": "4a9a6f37bd61cec65c23bbe45bfe79499ee11192d7c3e50e5a6f0bf68bdee281",
    "source_length": 28,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_34",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，快点。你可不想在这名暗黑之友的巢穴里与他交手。",
    "source_sha256": "0dbed8d7ef923e53a48c925ff58e66fac33994f0d8a7ea78a138b5c1741c73a3",
    "source_length": 69,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_35",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，快走。你的时间不多了。",
    "source_sha256": "5a3d640071136d9f04a5536f9baed1de26924e26d43ef5aa48b7dfd31ae58661",
    "source_length": 39,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_36",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "你的经验能帮助你辨认新法器的用途。捡起特法器后，查看它，了解使用方法。",
    "source_sha256": "6a69006fd3125ede74edda7b663b80d9720f0c1d6feb6ee1f2a7d8a06d7d532e",
    "source_length": 144,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_37",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "你可以用气流冲击打破或推开这些箱子。有些箱子包着铁，打不破；另一些则很容易打开。",
    "source_sha256": "8f1bd3e83e5bd5919bc1bd2a12e666e86982c33d11db95f1812b6b8fa859bed2",
    "source_length": 137,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_38",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，打破这个箱子。",
    "source_sha256": "6c94ff4e6580d3886ce41af7ad852994b4965f544244b743c2e4e2578187872a",
    "source_length": 30,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_39",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，打破这些箱子。",
    "source_sha256": "39f793539bca78ac2e32d5d37995eb4a8a8ac0193d7f754bc578875e7468d3ec",
    "source_length": 32,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_40",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "有些箱子里装着物品，这个里面是一件光球特法器。",
    "source_sha256": "0d55ffe5ae314c5fde641752e92c500d1f38ede563348c3f24c658764b4a6c5d",
    "source_length": 64,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_41",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "捡起来。",
    "source_sha256": "6919b1f1326d0f8607bcb336c4098a7ffc34b7f2d9ab19829221eaf2feaad58e",
    "source_length": 11,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_42",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "你触发了暗黑之友的一处陷阱。它保护着壁龛里的钥匙。",
    "source_sha256": "95a074ffcf601230347cd5a555f6af8ff8dc6f71e485e5a0ceec5e808b6c56f5",
    "source_length": 84,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_43",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "拿上钥匙。",
    "source_sha256": "1914c8149e44dbe2d288286832c1d8feef9d9ebfa855d23127560b0aaf2bd5ab",
    "source_length": 13,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_44",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "这道闸门没有加固。你应该能用气流冲击把它打破。",
    "source_sha256": "8419fdf0a13763a0a240a7dde875a1ca228492d7417534cfb1064a382013746c",
    "source_length": 89,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_45",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "再试试那扇门。这次你有钥匙了。",
    "source_sha256": "0ecfdf8255b6b11f5eb25fa6b640dfd563e67cc3f2eaabc50aac94649ec55218",
    "source_length": 47,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_46",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "这条走廊被一道加固的闸门挡住了，只有另一侧的拉杆才能打开它。你打不破这道门。",
    "source_sha256": "7a0bf7935a397368828ba031dc317a338c97bf7cab4b0a40f7306ee42636fdfc",
    "source_length": 120,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_47",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "不过，这里还有一件法器。拿起来，研究一下。特法器周围的光芒意味着：用完全部次数后，它会在这里重新出现。",
    "source_sha256": "fefd01ad58dda99e527a3129421c235f518fc26953967eda9f1240a06003bc82",
    "source_length": 159,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_48",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "走到闸门前，使用移位法器。",
    "source_sha256": "4465023fad31c6f0df7f688f82f4d70b5564a976564bb71f7f525fb3afddde77",
    "source_length": 53,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_49",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "现在拉动拉杆，打开闸门。",
    "source_sha256": "7ab886d5a15fb9ac5d3456c582b5987396519f238a3a9a4fb5861a2448087fc9",
    "source_length": 42,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_50",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "你用掉了移位法器唯一的一次使用机会，它便重新出现了。再拿起它，用它穿过剩下的闸门。",
    "source_sha256": "3001ac6b1d69ef4847b84de024c01dcdae9f209ed8992fe08bb2ba84d6ff0aeb",
    "source_length": 135,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_51",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "这是目前最致命的陷阱：接连不断的火球挡住了去路。不过，这里的火焰护盾法器能抵御火之编织，也能保护你免受环境中的火焰伤害。拿起并使用它，然后沿着这条走廊走过去。",
    "source_sha256": "4256bbb6dccdad56d4115c65b51a621d952da29d7fc6fd4040abd0392c451cb5",
    "source_length": 245,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_52",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "火焰护盾是一种被动防御，还有更强大的防御法器，比如这里的反射特法器。拿起来，研究一下，再用它对付陷阱。",
    "source_sha256": "4c854d703c4d84c5d366b7ba47ea9e0e5fa6a0057bea926b082a0aa072da34fd",
    "source_length": 172,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_53",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，这里很暗，你可以用光球照明。",
    "source_sha256": "aaf2c39c340ad95d6bd06a7227baaf65360a8d5df0718a2ebbc78da139a77ce2",
    "source_length": 59,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_54",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "你已经收集了不少特法器。何不用新得到的火球法器对付这处墙上的陷阱？",
    "source_sha256": "aa28b77c11e3224317a10465a02c47cc3a829642ef8b19467f2139e8221f8a9d",
    "source_length": 122,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_55",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，拱门就在那儿，只差几步了。",
    "source_sha256": "25dd9ef93f1e7364bae3e878597bdcb09c5a2b12cd843a3d68f09c7444ebe4d1",
    "source_length": 49,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_56",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "孩子，走路时得看清脚下。现在快爬上墙，离开这个可怕的地方。拱门不会一直留在那里。",
    "source_sha256": "0f7ed2a11ebe650cf8d007d3b07a86528f3f76ecbd56b9ebe51f9a4ddc59665f",
    "source_length": 136,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_57",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，没时间探索了。快去拱门！",
    "source_sha256": "2781931a2d8fcf1f8b7fd58dcadcc1c48c34a4518805980e5a8596fef7a69734",
    "source_length": 59,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_58",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "归途只会出现一次。",
    "source_sha256": "7d06c18ce76868d2de86bd6d9f922d85be46444cf139846d44b0609d4743b329",
    "source_length": 27,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_59",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "孩子，拱门！快去拱门！",
    "source_sha256": "c68d8657f10ed48a527a0ef5ecae4e0b09333a141841137f9fcd6624a93079eb",
    "source_length": 26,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_60",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "你必须离开这里。",
    "source_sha256": "6ec48bcc05125da4935adc88e0023952c2664b7bee8b9535e0925d5a6ff9fce6",
    "source_length": 20,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_61",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "姑娘，别犹豫。拱门不会一直留在那里。",
    "source_sha256": "fd81912e5b8553e22e2e5a954903dfb30c9def39120778c306c71c6e5c4d9302",
    "source_length": 51,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_62",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，镇定。你经受了许多，也学到了许多。我知道每次试炼都很艰难，但接下来才是最难的一关。第三次试炼，面对的是未来。归途只会出现一次。坚定你的意志。",
    "source_sha256": "7e363700fe74bab018cd7c62818f34941a1f9d6414d6b3971bd14f031347de5c",
    "source_length": 212,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_63",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "这一次，你是白塔的使者。一次外交任务将你带到了法达拉，这是一座位于边境地区的前哨堡垒，守军将暗帝的势力阻挡在妖境之内。他们没料到突如其来的集中猛攻，堡垒被攻陷了，敌人无疑是在找你。如今，兽魔人和魔达奥找到你藏身的房间，只是时间问题。你不能导引至上力，只能依靠同行的两仪师和护法保护，但他们寡不敌众。你唯一的机会，就是给入侵者设置陷阱。",
    "source_sha256": "9b6bc88443ca5a2ceb70b060f132177bde215f41c9a21beac6ab63c93358c9e8",
    "source_length": 593,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_64",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "这里只有一个出口，入侵者很可能就在门外。他们会从那里进来。从这扇门到你所在的大厅有两条路。你必须把入侵者引入其中一条走廊，确保他们踩中陷阱。放置一堵临时墙，堵住较短的那条路。",
    "source_sha256": "886aadbe3368047668e5971762cb0ea3007f9330108b78d5a0ac641f19cd8f50",
    "source_length": 326,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_65",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "孩子，别放那里。那样没什么用。再试一次。",
    "source_sha256": "96e0b670d9a0929a89e5391f7914a5b0dd0b81a15999850d2014247eb1f84d07",
    "source_length": 58,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_66",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "那里也不行。再试一次。",
    "source_sha256": "f924760002442f76f91d37eee2da73e2e9ac213a1f63d69e71b9ce9e3085340e",
    "source_length": 22,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_67",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "那里也不行。",
    "source_sha256": "7f8f47db22fe7213ab3afd76cc0d8a19051742a9c7c41177017c52b94ec2a235",
    "source_length": 17,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_68",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "别放那里。",
    "source_sha256": "8ebf404ae2131089706df363467a25be3759af4f9a29fdfd8d77fe00c7a2e263",
    "source_length": 10,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_69",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "很好，孩子。现在沿着剩下的走廊放置两个长矛陷阱。那里足够狭窄，长矛能发挥作用。",
    "source_sha256": "90fc8e37bbb42bf8aa330718c1ec10e4d6cf2cfb0a9869fecfea665d3a6925c5",
    "source_length": 123,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_70",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "很好。现在再放一个。",
    "source_sha256": "a9a6e94ff26f901ac092ad6c135a1a7d31355c1dc35fc4391f41809f89e1e2dd",
    "source_length": 21,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_71",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "很好，现在再放一个长矛陷阱。",
    "source_sha256": "8299764539659a76c076fe311440c001f3726ab16a8ee41fa231d92c240e9c4a",
    "source_length": 36,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_72",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "长矛虽然能伤到兽魔人，却拦不住它们；它们多半只会更加愤怒，冲出走廊，闯进大厅。在出口处挖个陷坑，倒是很适合迎接它们。",
    "source_sha256": "fdd05754340087af094099673856e0e6d5f2faf604df6543e1db24dd87548b20",
    "source_length": 193,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_73",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "现在安排你的同伴：那位两仪师和她的护法。把他们留在大厅里最稳妥，但你也可以把他们安排在任何地方。",
    "source_sha256": "0f915665d1c30e6037ee525f8a04ffb0f878d96fad81e5a6872bf33946889b93",
    "source_length": 146,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_74",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "如果愿意，你可以向两仪师下令。让她守卫当前位置，会是个有用的命令。她会自动命令附近的护法做同样的事。",
    "source_sha256": "f5fb9772a13557c04c1e3c825da539de764186e450aacc610497e7e9d269a7ae",
    "source_length": 167,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_75",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "孩子，再做一项防备：启动大厅后方壁龛前的闸门。它或许能救你一命。",
    "source_sha256": "cc4adc9ae54a94ce1bbd8d813ceffae82477a18c721437aa8735d3f5eb9fcdf5",
    "source_length": 131,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_76",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，你做得很好，也已经尽力做好了准备。鼓起勇气。成群的兽魔人正在门外聚集，这扇门挡不了它们多久。",
    "source_sha256": "387c11bbf0f74b1887ac9892f826a30e0b818806d6688abf95e3cd0ade9430ed",
    "source_length": 161,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_77",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，拱门出现了。你现在必须离开。",
    "source_sha256": "f491b2b6e1d681ba29d197c65967f8e9125319b2e6565f1d71c377a7c9bf5e30",
    "source_length": 51,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_78",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "别耽搁！拱门不会一直留在那里！",
    "source_sha256": "a3eb8426f64f94e3816d8ef5c3bda596d09dc6e435dec9797a5ce9304484a9f9",
    "source_length": 42,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_79",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，去拱门。趁你还能逃走，快离开。你已经没有办法救你的同伴了。",
    "source_sha256": "658a9e9b21b06f564b9cb4414621c312c5a661bb6caafc028bab7a066d720336",
    "source_length": 96,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  },
  {
    "file": "WoTsubtitles.int",
    "section": "DialogA",
    "key": "Tes_80",
    "occurrence": 1,
    "translation": "伊莱娜，你已洗净尘世的牵绊。你来到我们面前，心灵与灵魂都已洗净。如今你已与白塔缔结誓约。你准备好了。",
    "source_sha256": "f661e22576c5e892f8dc874e1638f95b3ff080563a8d9dd6b7fccc260c02633b",
    "source_length": 174,
    "tokens": [],
    "status": "draft"
  }
]
